            "review_title": "Review at Thien Tra Dao",
            "review_text": "Nhung\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nmy fave place in the city\nJan 2021\nMy fave place to have healthy vegan food. I came here many times before, usually had bun cha or the fresh rolls, now they have less food options but I don’t mind cuz my fave dishes are still there. Will definitely come back to try more tea (there are a lot!). \nP/s: they persuaded me to try the Pad thai because the weather was cold. Worth it! Hot and spicy and the portion is big!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 15, 2021",
            "rating": 4.0,
