            "review_text": "TravelinGypsey\n305 contributions\n0\nIn a peaceful neighborhood\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nIn a peaceful neighborhood with delicious food!! This is a hidden gem. The Cinnamon Orange tea (I got it hot) was amazing!!! Best tea I have had by far. The sticky rice was delicious as well and the salad hoa qua nhiet doi was perfect!! A must visit place- even if your not vegan 😊\nFollow @travelingypsey on Instagram & Google Maps \nSafe Travels!\nRead more\nWritten February 25, 2020",
