            "review_title": "Review at Thien Tra Dao",
            "review_text": "Loola\n8 contributions\n0\nShould Go there to try excellent Vietnamese food!\nMay 2018 • Friends\nWho said vegan food is boring? Only creative fresh and tasty food dishes here. Specialy have a crush with Bún Mọc, Bún Chả Hai Ngu and Đậu Nhật Om Nấm that I highly recomend...I used to go to 2 others well know vegan restaurants in Hanoi but I have to admit that is not that clean and fresh vegetables, also too oily. Almost 6 years in Hanoi and first time I feel like I am trying something new, not only with real vietnamese traditional receipes but also creative and elaborate. You can appreciate the service a lot as well, sweet and polite and the owner speaks fluently english! For a drink don't hesitate to go for Trà Tao Bach Hà, perfect to refresh and feel relax after a long working day\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 29, 2018",
