            "review_text": "Florian L\n1 contribution\n0\nA place to try even for a short visit in Hanoi!!!\nMay 2018 • Business\nThe atmosphere of this place makes you feel totally comfortable, and then the choice of food is very interesting. TOTALLY VEGAN AND HEALTHY!!! It’s one of the best or the best vegan restaurant in town. \nI highly recommend to try the: Tra Tao Bac Ha, which is a healthy apple mint cider tea.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 21, 2018",
